	text={
		[1]={
			{
"─The next day, Shino and I find ourselves swarmed by Republican students the moment we arrive at school.",
			},
		},
		[2]={
			{
"Even as we eat in the cafeteria, their gazes bore into us from every direction.",
			},
		},
		[3]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Shino, get rid of all these nosy Republicans.”",
			},
		},
		[4]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“I can't focus on my meal.”",
			},
		},
		[5]={
			{
"Hotori sullenly stirs her natto with her chopsticks.",
			},
		},
		[6]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Ahaha, well, she did announce her engagement most unceremoniously.”",
			},
		},
		[7]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Is it not natural that Kurushima-sama's classmates would have a lot of questions for her?”",
			},
		},
		[8]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Soujin, how're you coping with all the jealousy coming your way?”",
			},
		},
		[9]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Yeah, I have been getting a lot of death stares.”",
			},
		},
		[10]={
			{
"Shino went ahead and leaked our engagement to the press last night.",
			},
		},
		[11]={
			{
"The sudden announcement of the engagement of the Kurushima Group head shocked the whole Empire.",
			},
		},
		[12]={
			{
"And at the same time, it earned no shortage of ire from all the men who'd had their eyes on Shino.",
			},
		},
		[13]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“You really are sought after, huh?”",
			},
		},
		[14]={
			name={"name", name="Shino"},
			{
"“I ",
{"font", face="font/02.ttf", size=55, kerning=-3.5, hung=1},
"am",
{"/font"},
" the head of our Group, after all. You bet your ass I've got gold diggers lined up around the block.”",
			},
		},
		[15]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“I'd think it's because you're so beautiful.”",
			},
		},
		[16]={
			name={"name", name="Shino"},
			{
"“Hahaha, let's go with that, then.”",
			},
		},
		[17]={
			{
"Shino laughs heartily, plopping another piece of fried chicken into her mouth.",
			},
		},
		[18]={
			{
"That's when a group of Republicans approaches us.",
			},
		},
		[19]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Mrgh.”",
			},
		},
		[20]={
			{
"They lay their hands on Shino's shoulder like they're the best of friends.",
			},
		},
		[21]={
			{
"These Republicans have some nerve.",
			},
		},
		[22]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Hyaaah! A-Akari-sama, Soujin-sama's eyes are screaming bloody murder!”",
			},
		},
		[23]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Simmer down now.”",
			},
		},
		[24]={
			{
"Meanwhile, Shino explains herself to the persistent Republicans, looking more and more exasperated.",
			},
		},
		[25]={
			{
"Finally reaching her boiling point, she leaps to her feet in irritation.",
			},
		},
		[26]={
			name={"name", name="Shino"},
			{
"“Haah, what a pain.”",
			},
		},
		[27]={
			name={"name", name="Shino"},
			{
"“Soujin?”",
			},
		},
		[28]={
			{
"Shino grabs me by the arm and pulls me to my feet.",
			},
		},
		[29]={
			name={"name", name="Shino"},
			{
"“Ladies and germs, allow me to introduce you to my fiancé.”",
			},
		},
		[30]={
			name={"name", name="Shino"},
			{
"“This is Tokita Soujin, a warrior.”",
			},
		},
		[31]={
			{
"Shino links her arm with me as if to show off our closeness.",
			},
		},
		[32]={
			{
"She presses her soft breasts right against me as she leans in close.",
			},
		},
		[33]={
			{
"With my arm buried deep within her chest, I can't help but feel restless.",
			},
		},
		[34]={
			name={"name", name="Shino"},
			{
"“And just so we're clear, the whole engagement was my idea.”",
			},
		},
		[35]={
			{
"The Republicans still refuse to back down.",
			},
		},
		[36]={
			name={"name", name="Shino"},
			{
"“God, they're persistent.”",
			},
		},
		[37]={
			name={"name", name="Shino"},
			{
"“Soujin, lookie here one sec.”",
			},
		},
		[38]={
			{
"Shino pins my cheeks between her hands the moment I turn in her direction.",
			},
		},
		[39]={
			{
"In the midst of my confusion, Shino stretches up on her toes and steals a kiss before I can even get a word in edgewise.",
			},
		},
		[40]={
			name={"name", name="Shino"},
			{
"“Nmh... mwah...”",
			},
		},
		[41]={
			{
"The shock of her sneak attack freezes me in place.",
			},
		},
		[42]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“O-O-Ohhhhhhhh!”",
			},
		},
		[43]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Shino's so bold...”",
			},
		},
		[44]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“I'm embarrassed just watching them...”",
			},
		},
		[45]={
			{
"Shino finally releases my lips.",
			},
		},
		[46]={
			name={"name", name="Shino"},
			{
"“Heheheh, this is totally normal in the Republic.”",
			},
		},
		[47]={
			{
"All the boys watching on with a soft spot for Shino practically scream in despair.",
			},
		},
		[48]={
			name={"name", name="Shino"},
			{
"“Whew, that sure felt good.”",
			},
		},
		[49]={
			name={"name", name="Shino"},
			{
"“Right, while we're at it, let's head straight off for the Republic, Soujin.”",
			},
		},
		[50]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Huh?”",
			},
		},
		[51]={
			name={"name", name="Shino"},
			{
"“The sooner we can break ground in the Republic, the better.”",
			},
		},
		[52]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Wait, but I haven't made any─”",
			},
		},
		[53]={
			name={"name", name="Shino"},
			{
"“Don't sweat the small stuff. We'll be back by next week.”",
			},
		},
		[54]={
			name={"name", name="Shino"},
			{
"“I've already arranged a private jet, so let's make like a tree.”",
			},
		},
		[55]={
			{
"She's as flippant as usual, but it really doesn't sound like\nshe's joking.",
			},
		},
		[56]={
			{
"Still holding my arm, she starts trying to drag me off.",
			},
		},
		[57]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“So this is what you mean by running me ragged...”",
			},
		},
		[58]={
			name={"name", name="Shino"},
			{
"“Hahaha, don't lie. You enjoy it, don't you?”",
			},
		},
		[59]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“You're not wrong.”",
			},
		},
		[60]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Akari, sorry, but...”",
			},
		},
		[61]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Yeah, yeah, don't you worry about me.”",
			},
		},
		[62]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“You can trust that the Empire's in good hands.”",
			},
		},
		[63]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Have a safe trip, Soujin-sama.”",
			},
		},
		[64]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Ah, I would appreciate some sweets as a souvenir, if you please!”",
			},
		},
		[65]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Soujin, make sure you protect Shino.”",
			},
		},
		[66]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Yeah, you bet.”",
			},
		},
		[67]={
			{
"Shino tugs me by the arm as the three girls send me off.",
			},
		},
		[68]={
			name={"name", name="Shino"},
			{
"“All righty, let's blow this joint, Soujin.”",
			},
		},
		[69]={
			{
"Hand in hand with Shino, I leave the cafeteria.",
			},
		},
		[70]={
			{
"With every step I take, my heart soars as I imagine my future with Shino.",
			},
		},
		[71]={
			{
"─Years later, we still keep up our hectic jet-setting lifestyle between the Empire and the Republic.",
			},
		},
		[72]={
			{
"With Shino at its helm, the Kurushima Group made its grand entrance into the Republic's economy, and managed to repair relations between our two countries.",
			},
		},
		[73]={
			{
"And behind her every step of the way, I supported her with my newly-acquired business acumen that nowadays rivals my knowledge of the blade.",
			},
		},
	},
	label={
	},
}
